>> phrases := لسٽ نئون
	~ ⌝'abcd'⌜
	~ ⌝'hello world'⌜
	~ ⌝''⌜
	~ ⌝'@.,;"'⌜
	~ ⌝'this is a much much longer string to be encoded!'⌜.

>> message := ⌝'Phrase: ~decoded base64: ~encoded'⌜.
	
phrases هر-هڪ: ⎬ :_ :phrase 
	>> e := Server base64-انڪوڊ: phrase.
	>> d := Server base64-ڊيڪوڊ: e.
	آئوٽ-پٽ لکو: ﴿
		message نقل ~encoded: e, ~decoded: d
	﴾, نئين-سٽ.
⎨.
